@page "/docs/primitives/checkbox-group"

<DocsPage Title="Checkbox Group" Description="Provides shared state to a series of checkboxes.">
    <ComponentPreview Name="primitives/checkbox-group-hero" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Usage guidelines" />
    <ul>
        <li>
            <strong>Form controls must have an accessible name:</strong> give them one with <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>
            elements, or the <a href="/docs/primitives/field">Field</a> and <a href="/docs/primitives/fieldset">Fieldset</a>
            parts. See <a href="#labeling-a-checkbox-group">Labeling a checkbox group</a>.
        </li>
    </ul>
    <DocsHeading Title="Anatomy" />
    <p>Checkbox Group is composed together with <a href="/docs/primitives/checkbox">Checkbox</a>. Import the primitives and assemble the parts:</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@Anatomy" />
    <DocsHeading Title="Examples" />
    <DocsHeading Level="3" Title="Labeling a checkbox group" />
    <p>Label the group with <code>aria-labelledby</code> and a sibling label element:</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@GroupLabelCode" Title="Using aria-labelledby to label a checkbox group" />
    <p>An enclosing <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> is the simplest labeling pattern for each checkbox:</p>
    <CodeFigure Code="@ItemLabelCode" Title="Using an enclosing label to label a checkbox" />
    <DocsHeading Level="3" Title="Parent checkbox" />
    <p>A checkbox that controls the other checkboxes in a <code>CheckboxGroupRoot</code> can be created:</p>
    <ol>
        <li>Bind the group's <code>Value</code>.</li>
        <li>Pass the values of all the child checkboxes to the group's <code>AllValues</code> parameter.</li>
        <li>Set <code>Parent</code> on the parent <code>CheckboxRoot</code>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
        The group sets the parent checkbox's <a href="/docs/primitives/checkbox">indeterminate</a> state when some, but not
        all, of the child checkboxes are checked.
    </p>
    <ComponentPreview Name="primitives/checkbox-group-parent" />
    <DocsHeading Title="API Reference" />
    <PartReference Type="typeof(CheckboxGroupRoot)">
        <DataAttributes>
            <StyleHook Name="data-disabled">Present when the checkbox group is disabled.</StyleHook>
        </DataAttributes>
    </PartReference>
</DocsPage>

@code {
    private const string Anatomy = """
        @using Blazix.Primitives

        <CheckboxGroupRoot>
            <CheckboxRoot />
        </CheckboxGroupRoot>
        """;

    private const string GroupLabelCode = """
        <div id="protocols-label">Allowed network protocols</div>
        <CheckboxGroupRoot aria-labelledby="protocols-label">...</CheckboxGroupRoot>
        """;

    private const string ItemLabelCode = """
        <label>
            <CheckboxRoot Value="http" />
            HTTP
        </label>
        """;
}
